WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:39.950 --> 01:44.750
The paper I just handed out is a notice for parent conferences.

01:44.750 --> 01:50.590
<i>Parent conferences include me, the teacher and my parents.</i>

01:50.590 --> 01:52.050
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:53.300 --> 01:54.130
Chiaki?

01:57.590 --> 01:59.470
I don't have any parents.

02:00.300 --> 02:05.770
- Um, please hand in the paper by tomorrow.

02:04.140 --> 02:05.770
- Eh?! Why?!

02:05.770 --> 02:10.400
But these conferences are important because they're about you.

02:10.400 --> 02:12.730
Then, could you take my place during school cleaning duty today?

02:12.730 --> 02:14.110
And tomorrow's, too?

02:14.110 --> 02:17.110
But those aren't my...

02:17.110 --> 02:19.950
Those ARE your problems now!

02:19.950 --> 02:22.700
- We leave it up to you, Class President!

02:21.030 --> 02:22.700
- Good luck, Class President!

02:25.080 --> 02:26.950
O-Okay...

02:27.290 --> 02:33.960
Forceful Confession at the Amusement Park!

02:37.970 --> 02:42.010
I'm such a worthless guy.

02:42.010 --> 02:44.810
I can't do anything right...

02:46.140 --> 02:49.270
I'm... such a wimp.

02:53.610 --> 02:55.650
A painting.

02:55.650 --> 02:57.440
A beautiful one, at that.

02:57.440 --> 03:01.610
Were you thrown away because you weren't needed anymore?

03:02.490 --> 03:08.040
Not needed by anyone... Can't do anything right...

03:08.960 --> 03:11.580
<i>Do you want to be needed?</i>

03:12.630 --> 03:16.130
<i>Do you hate yourself when you can't do anything?</i>

03:16.130 --> 03:18.300
<i>Do you want to change?</i>

03:18.300 --> 03:20.470
<i>Do you want to be strong?</i>

03:20.470 --> 03:24.100
<i>Come closer. Accept me.</i>

03:24.100 --> 03:28.270
<i>Then I will grant your wish.</i>

03:28.270 --> 03:30.640
<i>You want to change, right?</i>

03:30.640 --> 03:34.560
<i>Answer me honestly and speak for yourself!</i>

03:34.560 --> 03:37.150
- Good morning!

03:35.520 --> 03:37.150
- Did you do that paper?

03:37.190 --> 03:38.190
Not yet.

03:41.950 --> 03:44.030
Why didn't that damn Miyako come wake me up?

03:44.030 --> 03:48.540
She didn't have to go without me, just because I was sleeping! Now I'll be late for class again!

03:49.910 --> 03:52.500
Class President! What are you doing here?

03:54.250 --> 03:57.300
This time, I <i>did</i> keep in mind the perfect place...

03:57.300 --> 03:59.050
...unlike last time.

03:59.050 --> 04:02.760
Stop joking around, Class President.

04:04.090 --> 04:06.430
<i>The Petit Claire is reacting to a Demon...</i>

04:06.430 --> 04:09.270
<i>Oh no, did you get possessed by another Demon?!</i>

04:10.140 --> 04:12.390
You're lonely, right?

04:12.390 --> 04:15.060
Every human is alone.

04:15.060 --> 04:20.280
There are always people like me who are in need of people like you.

04:20.280 --> 04:23.240
Stop... Wait just a minute!

04:24.660 --> 04:25.780
No!!!

04:28.620 --> 04:34.670
If you can be forceful in seducing a girl, then I can be forceful in rescuing a girl. Right, Class President?

04:34.670 --> 04:36.130
Chiaki...

04:36.130 --> 04:37.880
Oh, well...

04:37.880 --> 04:38.210
What?

04:43.550 --> 04:47.550
You are not worthy of Maron-san.

04:47.550 --> 04:50.770
The man she needs is me.

04:51.470 --> 04:53.310
What's with him?

04:54.690 --> 04:56.310
Are you okay, Maron?

04:57.860 --> 05:00.440
- Why did you help me?

04:59.860 --> 05:00.440
- Huh?

05:00.480 --> 05:04.150
Leave me alone! I could have stopped him by myself!

05:10.830 --> 05:13.750
<i>I don't need any help! I'm strong enough!</i>

05:13.750 --> 05:17.920
<i>I can deal with my own problems!</i>

05:22.840 --> 05:25.800
That guy is possessed by a Demon again.

05:25.800 --> 05:29.760
I know. We have to find out where the Demon is.

05:29.760 --> 05:34.640
He's certainly weak.. That's twice now that he's been possessed.

05:34.640 --> 05:35.770
That's true...

05:36.890 --> 05:43.860
Anyway, <i>you</i> helping somebody else isn't something that happens every day.

05:43.860 --> 05:46.610
It can't be... Did you seriously fall in love with her?

05:46.610 --> 05:49.950
Waiting for her outside of the building and all...

05:49.950 --> 05:54.790
Yeah, right. It's just easier to get closer to her if it seems that I like her.

05:56.500 --> 05:59.170
I'm just being moody, that's all.

06:01.790 --> 06:05.760
Is the Class President the type that's easily possessed by Demons?

06:05.760 --> 06:10.550
- People with self-esteem issues are easily targeted.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.550
- Hmm...

06:10.550 --> 06:15.390
But when I went to his house, there wasn't anything that a Demon might hide in.

06:15.390 --> 06:16.640
Really?

06:16.640 --> 06:20.350
But what is it that he wants from me?

06:23.320 --> 06:25.530
These guys are so stupid!

06:25.530 --> 06:28.490
Miyako! What are you doing here?!

06:28.490 --> 06:30.530
Is there a problem with that?

06:30.530 --> 06:34.330
Mom told me to bring you dinner.

06:34.330 --> 06:35.450
Anyway...

06:35.450 --> 06:37.750
...right now, were you talking to someone?

06:39.870 --> 06:42.340
O-Of course not!

06:42.340 --> 06:45.000
Th-Thank your mom for me!

06:45.000 --> 06:46.710
One more thing...

06:46.710 --> 06:47.550
Huh?

06:48.340 --> 06:50.760
Momokuri Amusement Park?

06:50.760 --> 06:52.800
Yep, the Class President gave them to me.

06:52.800 --> 06:53.760
Our Class President did?

06:54.810 --> 06:56.890
He invited all four of us to go.

06:56.890 --> 06:58.390
All four of us...?

06:58.390 --> 06:59.770
You and me...

06:59.770 --> 07:01.650
...Class President and Chiaki.

07:01.650 --> 07:03.730
Oh, the usual gang.

07:03.730 --> 07:06.690
<i>Then, if Miyako and Chiaki are coming, there's nothing to worry about!</i>

07:06.690 --> 07:09.030
<i>Not really!</i>

07:09.030 --> 07:09.990
I'll pass!

07:09.990 --> 07:11.280
Tomorrow at 10 o'clock!

07:11.280 --> 07:13.990
Hey, Miyako! I'm not going!

07:13.990 --> 07:16.370
I'll never go, you hear?!

07:17.370 --> 07:18.500
Geez...

07:18.500 --> 07:21.710
Maron! It's a trap!

07:21.710 --> 07:24.040
I know. I'm aware that it's a trap.

07:26.050 --> 07:27.340
That's why I should go.

07:27.340 --> 07:29.300
Eeehhh?!

07:29.300 --> 07:31.260
He's challenging me.

07:31.260 --> 07:34.260
There's no way I'm declining!

07:40.100 --> 07:42.140
She does seem pretty mad, after all...

07:42.140 --> 07:44.440
She really is stubborn...

07:46.730 --> 07:48.610
Maron, you dropped something!

07:59.290 --> 08:02.620
She really did want to come...

08:04.960 --> 08:07.170
No wonder.

08:07.170 --> 08:09.960
It's her first time at an amusement park.

08:09.960 --> 08:10.760
First time?

08:10.760 --> 08:17.140
She said it was a challenge, but she really just wanted to go to the amusement park...

08:23.060 --> 08:24.520
Kusakabe-san!

08:25.690 --> 08:26.860
Class President!

08:26.860 --> 08:28.570
Thank goodness it's sunny.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.900
<i>Looks like the normal Class President...</i>

08:31.900 --> 08:34.740
<i>...but I still better be careful!</i>

08:34.740 --> 08:37.700
My parents sponsor this park...

08:37.700 --> 08:40.200
...but it's a subdivision of my grandfather's company.

08:40.200 --> 08:42.200
<i>Then that means...</i>

08:42.200 --> 08:44.920
<i>...the Demon is somewhere in here!</i>

08:44.920 --> 08:48.540
I'll go look for it. Don't let your guard down, Maron!

08:48.540 --> 08:49.710
Okay!

08:50.500 --> 08:54.010
Huh? What are you doing?

08:54.300 --> 08:56.930
Notice

08:54.300 --> 08:56.930
Don't go away!

08:54.300 --> 08:56.930
I'll return right after these messages!

08:54.300 --> 08:56.930
Kaitou Jeanne

08:57.890 --> 09:00.470
Notice

08:57.890 --> 09:00.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

08:57.890 --> 09:00.470
Kaitou Jeanne

09:12.150 --> 09:14.070
He's so cool!

09:15.070 --> 09:17.530
Let's go in here next!

09:18.320 --> 09:20.620
Is this the haunted house?

09:21.490 --> 09:24.710
Are you scared, Maron? Want me to go with you?

09:24.710 --> 09:26.870
I'm not scared at all!

09:26.870 --> 09:30.460
Chiaki! I'm scared! Let's go in together!

09:30.460 --> 09:32.090
<i>Liar!</i>

09:32.090 --> 09:36.430
<i>One time, you scared the person playing the ghost in a haunted house!</i>

09:36.430 --> 09:38.930
Well, let's go in together.

09:38.930 --> 09:39.850
O-Okay!

09:39.850 --> 09:41.600
<i>I'm ready!</i>

09:44.770 --> 09:46.730
Wow, it's pitch black!

09:46.730 --> 09:48.270
I-It really is!

09:51.110 --> 09:52.440
Are you scared?

09:52.440 --> 09:54.440
I... I'm s-sorry...

09:54.440 --> 09:57.530
You don't have to apologize. Good on you for being honest!

09:57.530 --> 10:01.780
But Kusakabe-san... You like strong guys more, don't you?

10:03.120 --> 10:06.750
It's not that I like strong guys especially...

10:06.750 --> 10:08.420
But I absolutely hate faint-hearted people!

10:08.420 --> 10:10.080
Absolutely?!

10:10.080 --> 10:12.210
Yep, absolutely hate.

10:12.210 --> 10:14.380
Well, let's go.

10:17.170 --> 10:19.260
Is that so...

10:19.260 --> 10:21.050
Then I can't become...

10:22.970 --> 10:26.850
...a guy worthy enough for you, Maron-san.

10:33.320 --> 10:35.030
Class President...?

10:37.150 --> 10:41.700
So it was a trap to make me all alone.

10:50.250 --> 10:52.000
Alone...

10:53.420 --> 10:55.130
Darkness...

10:55.880 --> 10:58.510
<i>Are you afraid of the dark?</i>

10:58.510 --> 10:59.300
Who's there?!

11:01.760 --> 11:04.470
<i>You are afraid of the shadows, aren't you?</i>

11:05.180 --> 11:08.600
Oh, that scared me! It's made to talk like that, huh?

11:08.600 --> 11:11.810
<i>Are you afraid of the darkness?</i>

11:11.810 --> 11:13.480
This painting is...

11:17.900 --> 11:19.740
...me.

11:19.740 --> 11:22.410
<i>Maron, be a good girl.</i>

11:22.410 --> 11:24.910
<i>I'll call you before I come home.</i>

11:24.910 --> 11:30.250
I feel loneliness, despair, and fear every time the sun goes down.

11:31.830 --> 11:34.080
<i>I see...</i>

11:34.080 --> 11:37.090
<i>So you're afraid of the night...</i>

11:37.090 --> 11:43.840
<i>I can release you from your loneliness.</i>

11:44.640 --> 11:47.470
<i>Accept me!</i>

11:48.520 --> 11:50.020
Noooooooooo!!!

11:51.270 --> 11:52.560
Ah, Chiaki!

11:52.560 --> 11:54.270
<i>It can't be... a Demon?!</i>

11:57.900 --> 11:58.900
Maron!!!

12:04.070 --> 12:05.070
Maron!

12:06.160 --> 12:08.120
Were you scared by a ghost?

12:09.370 --> 12:11.250
Did Minazuki do something to you?

12:16.340 --> 12:18.880
It's okay now, Maron.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.840
It's okay.

12:24.090 --> 12:25.260
Maron?

12:28.680 --> 12:30.310
We're outside already.

12:31.930 --> 12:33.100
Huh?

12:35.400 --> 12:39.610
<i>How humiliating! Chiaki saw me crying!</i>

12:39.610 --> 12:43.610
We got separated from Miyako, so let's look for them on the ferris wheel.

12:43.610 --> 12:44.110
Huh?

12:45.280 --> 12:48.120
Aren't you going to ask me why I was crying?

12:48.120 --> 12:51.250
I was sure you'd tease me about it right away.

12:55.460 --> 12:56.500
What's wrong, Maron?

12:56.500 --> 12:57.880
Did something happen?

12:57.880 --> 12:59.090
Fin!

13:00.380 --> 13:03.800
That's right. Fin is with me.

13:03.800 --> 13:05.130
Nothing...

13:05.130 --> 13:07.140
It's nothing, Fin.

13:08.010 --> 13:12.140
It's weird. I should have known that you're always with me.

13:12.140 --> 13:15.140
Maron, what's wrong?

13:15.140 --> 13:18.810
It's strange. I should be stronger.

13:18.810 --> 13:20.480
Maron, aren't you coming?

13:22.320 --> 13:23.440
I'm coming!

13:24.320 --> 13:28.240
Wow! What a beautiful view!

13:29.410 --> 13:32.120
But it's nothing compared to the view of your underw--

13:32.120 --> 13:34.160
Don't you dare say anything about that again!

13:35.040 --> 13:37.290
Anyway, did you think about it?

13:37.290 --> 13:38.670
About what?

13:38.670 --> 13:40.710
About going out with me.

13:40.710 --> 13:41.880
You're just teasing me.

13:41.880 --> 13:45.130
No, I'm not. I'm serious.

13:45.880 --> 13:47.380
It's a confession of love.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.850
<i>I don't like his eyes.</i>

13:50.850 --> 13:53.810
<i>It's as if they're looking through me.</i>

13:53.810 --> 13:57.100
I'm really serious.

13:57.100 --> 13:58.560
Can't you tell?

14:04.190 --> 14:05.610
Chiaki...

14:05.610 --> 14:07.320
Hmm...?

14:07.320 --> 14:11.450
Chiaki, why did you throw away the paper about the parent conferences?

14:13.040 --> 14:15.910
Do you see that merry-go-round?

14:16.910 --> 14:23.090
My father used to have a job at an amusement park, operating a merry-go-round.

14:24.340 --> 14:29.840
He said that once, a lady was looking at the merry-go-round after a rainy day.

14:29.840 --> 14:35.810
When he talked to her, she said that she couldn't get on because her dress would get dirty.

14:35.810 --> 14:39.270
My dad became a step to her so she could get on.

14:39.270 --> 14:43.770
Several months passed by and my father started working as an architect...

14:43.770 --> 14:46.940
...ans was given the job of remodelling that amusement park.

14:46.940 --> 14:48.150
And then...

14:48.650 --> 14:53.240
<i>I'll be assisting you with the remodelling of this park.</i>

14:53.240 --> 14:54.910
Oh!

15:00.290 --> 15:03.790
Well? Seems like they were destined to be together, right?

15:03.790 --> 15:07.460
That lady was, of course, my mother.

15:07.460 --> 15:11.470
But, before I could grasp the reality of it all, things started going badly...

15:11.470 --> 15:16.310
...and they left for overseas before I was ten...

15:17.060 --> 15:19.140
...leaving me behind...

15:19.140 --> 15:20.850
...all alone.

15:24.650 --> 15:29.400
I...don't know what love is.

15:29.400 --> 15:31.410
Nobody told me...

15:33.490 --> 15:38.580
Hey. Do people fall in love that easily?

15:38.580 --> 15:41.080
Is that why they can hate people just as easily?

15:47.130 --> 15:50.840
I can't believe in love.

15:50.840 --> 15:53.890
I don't even know how...

15:53.890 --> 15:55.300
I...

15:59.730 --> 16:03.440
This is probably being done by the Demon that's possessing the Class President.

16:03.440 --> 16:04.560
Fin!

16:06.060 --> 16:08.400
It's too dark to see anything.

16:08.400 --> 16:10.490
Huh? Yeah...

16:10.490 --> 16:15.370
At a time like this, we should just stay quiet and not do anything to avoid danger.

16:15.370 --> 16:17.830
Yeah, I guess so.

16:20.910 --> 16:21.660
Fin!

16:21.660 --> 16:25.210
Maron, the Demon is in the painting in the haunted house.

16:25.210 --> 16:26.840
The haunted house?

16:27.380 --> 16:28.710
The painting...

16:29.710 --> 16:31.170
Fin, let's go!

16:31.170 --> 16:32.420
Okay.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.930
Let's go!

16:39.970 --> 16:42.600
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:52.440 --> 16:54.320
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:54.320 --> 16:56.070
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:56.070 --> 16:57.910
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

17:02.700 --> 17:04.830
So reckless...

17:05.460 --> 17:07.710
Why did the power go out so suddenly?

17:08.710 --> 17:10.590
A notice card from Jeanne?

17:11.170 --> 17:17.840
<i>"I will take the beauty of the painting of the beautiful, young girl inside the haunted house." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

17:17.840 --> 17:19.300
What?!

17:20.970 --> 17:23.100
The Petit Claire is reacting to the Demon!

17:23.680 --> 17:25.020
Just as I thought...

17:26.600 --> 17:28.020
It's this painting.

17:29.060 --> 17:30.110
<i>Checkmate!</i>

17:32.030 --> 17:33.740
Sinbad...

17:33.740 --> 17:36.320
Are you going to get in my way again?

17:36.320 --> 17:38.950
Get in your way?

17:38.950 --> 17:43.790
I just want a girl to act more like a girl.

17:43.790 --> 17:45.080
Sorry!

17:46.920 --> 17:49.290
But you only get to be a spectator this time!

17:51.170 --> 17:54.090
I won't let a single Demon escape!

17:56.380 --> 17:58.300
In the name of God...

18:01.220 --> 18:04.270
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:04.270 --> 18:05.890
Class President!

18:05.890 --> 18:08.440
<i>There's no use sealing me.</i>

18:08.440 --> 18:14.320
<i>Those with beautiful hearts can stray from their pureness.</i>

18:14.320 --> 18:20.570
<i>As long as those with beauty in their hearts exist, we will continue to possess them.</i>

18:20.570 --> 18:23.410
<i>What you're doing is meaningless.</i>

18:23.410 --> 18:26.370
What I'm doing is meaningless...

18:26.370 --> 18:28.210
Jeanne! Don't listen to him!

18:28.750 --> 18:31.460
<i>No one needs you.</i>

18:31.460 --> 18:34.550
No one needs me...

18:35.460 --> 18:37.220
I'm alone...

18:43.600 --> 18:46.430
You talk too much!!

18:46.430 --> 18:47.640
<i>What?!</i>

18:47.640 --> 18:51.020
You're not the one who decides whether my actions are worthless or not.

18:51.020 --> 18:52.150
I am!

18:52.150 --> 18:52.940
Jeanne.

18:53.360 --> 18:54.980
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:13.750 --> 19:15.420
<i>Collection completed!</i>

19:16.760 --> 19:18.340
Huh? What was I...?

19:18.340 --> 19:20.300
- You there...

19:20.300 --> 19:24.010
Do you know what "faint-hearted" is?

19:24.010 --> 19:27.720
It's someone who says they can't do anything.

19:27.720 --> 19:31.230
It's not that you can't do anything. You're just not trying.

19:31.230 --> 19:33.810
It's okay to get stuck or to be troubled.

19:33.810 --> 19:36.610
But challenge yourself rather than just running away!

19:36.610 --> 19:40.240
There's nothing you can't do.

19:41.660 --> 19:42.990
Jeanne...

19:43.870 --> 19:46.240
Right, Sinbad-san?

19:47.700 --> 19:50.160
This time, I wasn't needed...

19:53.750 --> 19:56.460
Consider what Jeanne has just said.

19:56.460 --> 19:57.500
Eh?

20:02.720 --> 20:06.010
Damn! I was too late!

20:06.010 --> 20:10.480
Jeanne, it's unfair to send a notice card just before you go into action.

20:11.350 --> 20:15.150
I've gotten another deceptive beauty tonight!

20:18.150 --> 20:20.490
The power is finally back on.

20:20.490 --> 20:23.160
So it's okay to talk now, huh?

20:28.910 --> 20:30.830
<i>That was close...</i>

20:33.580 --> 20:35.880
There you are!

20:35.880 --> 20:38.710
Maron, it's unfair of you to be alone with him!

20:38.710 --> 20:39.760
It's not like that...

20:39.760 --> 20:41.970
Then, what is it like?

20:41.970 --> 20:44.220
Everyone, I've made a promise to myself.

20:44.220 --> 20:44.890
Huh?

20:44.890 --> 20:48.640
I will capture Sinbad for Kusakabe-san.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.270
Eh?

20:50.270 --> 20:51.390
Why?

20:51.390 --> 20:55.310
I wanted to try something big.

20:55.310 --> 20:57.190
I'm going to change.

20:57.190 --> 20:59.070
Whatever...

20:59.070 --> 21:00.860
You can't do something like that!

21:00.860 --> 21:04.650
That's a job for a detective like me, Toudaiji Miyako!

21:04.650 --> 21:07.990
I may not be able to do it, but I just want to do what I can!

21:07.990 --> 21:10.580
Fine then, I accept your challenge! Let's see who catches him first!

21:10.580 --> 21:12.080
I definitely won't lose!

21:15.000 --> 21:16.710
Hey, Chiaki.

21:16.710 --> 21:17.710
Hmm?

21:18.670 --> 21:21.000
About what you were saying earlier...

21:21.000 --> 21:22.710
What was I saying?

21:22.710 --> 21:25.130
That you wanted to go out with me.

21:25.130 --> 21:27.220
Oh yeah, that was...

21:27.220 --> 21:28.350
I'm sorry...

21:28.350 --> 21:30.970
Oh, it's okay...

21:32.220 --> 21:33.850
But...

21:38.690 --> 21:39.980
Thank you!

21:49.910 --> 21:52.950
It's too early to think that you're worthy enough to oppose me!

21:55.540 --> 21:56.790
I'm just...

22:00.130 --> 22:01.840
...being moody, that's all.

22:05.420 --> 22:11.260
For billions of years,

22:11.350 --> 22:20.810
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:22.980 --> 22:29.450
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.700 --> 22:35.750
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.370 --> 22:39.170
The huge mountains...

22:41.880 --> 22:48.800
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.300 --> 22:53.850
It took everything.

22:56.100 --> 23:02.060
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.150 --> 23:09.070
we watched the world ending...

23:09.280 --> 23:15.120
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.920
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.430 --> 23:34.850
The promise with the little boy...

23:34.850 --> 23:39.230
I will definitely help his mother, whose heart has been stolen by a Demon.

23:39.230 --> 23:42.100
Hmph, what can you do with that injury?

23:42.100 --> 23:44.190
Sinbad...

23:44.190 --> 23:47.110
Why are you helping me?

23:47.110 --> 23:51.820
Are you an enemy... or an ally?

23:51.820 --> 23:56.240
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: First Kiss under the Shining Moonlight!

23:56.240 --> 23:59.910
Jeanne, I want you to quit being a Kaitou.
